# ==========================================================================
#  STATE 15  CLEAR LINES
#  one pass from row 4 down to row 25
#  a walker carries the row counter in field 4 and counts filled well
#  squares in field 5  When it reaches the start of the next row with a
#  count of ten the row above it is full  It drops a breadcrumb there by
#  zeroing F  then walks backwards pulling every square down from 16
#  squares above until it meets square 63 whose F was zeroed as a stop
#  sign  Then it rebuilds the ceiling  tallies the line in square 63
#  and scans forward to its breadcrumb
# ==========================================================================
